WEBVTT

00:12.420 --> 00:13.700
Ouka-chan.

00:14.800 --> 00:15.950
What is it?

00:15.950 --> 00:18.540
We're just about to close up here...

00:20.470 --> 00:22.910
Ouka-san! Check it out!

00:22.910 --> 00:24.380
Bwong!

00:24.380 --> 00:26.880
Got a new pair! Aren't they great?

00:29.240 --> 00:31.000
Are you messing around?!

00:31.000 --> 00:32.920
Take your work seriously!

00:39.000 --> 00:41.600
What's gotten into you, Ouka-chan?

00:41.600 --> 00:44.380
Did you have to talk to her like that?

00:44.850 --> 00:46.230
Ouka-chan?

00:46.510 --> 00:47.880
Did something happen?

00:49.520 --> 00:50.410
Hey.

00:51.400 --> 00:53.780
You know, you...

00:53.780 --> 00:55.300
So then...

00:58.580 --> 01:00.660
Wh-What's wrong, Ami-chan?

01:00.660 --> 01:03.130
Did Hayato-kun yell at you again?

01:03.130 --> 01:06.620
No! Listen to this... Ouka-san...

01:07.890 --> 01:09.500
Wh-What?!

01:09.500 --> 01:12.170
Oh, so this is where you were.

01:13.080 --> 01:15.500
Your webpage said you had two locations.

01:15.500 --> 01:17.220
I didn't know which one to go to.

01:17.760 --> 01:19.610
D-D...

01:20.120 --> 01:21.760
Doppelgänger?!

01:22.950 --> 01:25.850
Why did you come here, Kikka?

01:43.080 --> 01:45.660
<b></b>The Café Terrace and Its Goddesses

02:59.790 --> 03:02.250
She really does look just like her.

03:00.150 --> 03:04.990
<b>Episode 10: "Ouka and Kikka"</b>

03:00.180 --> 03:04.990
<b>Episode 10: "Ouka and Kikka"</b>

